  "body": "A rare and unique opportunity to purchase a truly exceptional family residence where style, substance and location combine to deliver something incredibly special.\r\n\r\nHaving undergone a significant transformation, this exceptional residence has been thoughtfully redesigned to create an outstanding family home where contemporary style, refined interiors and effortless functionality come together beautifully.\r\n\r\nA superb example of modern family living, the home offers an impressive and highly versatile floor plan, with generous proportions and multiple living spaces designed to accommodate families of all ages and stages.\r\n\r\nNicely elevated to capture beautiful outlooks across Madills Farm, towards Rangitoto and beyond to the sea, the home enjoys an abundance of natural light and all-day sun.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the open-plan kitchen, living and dining area is complemented by a bespoke gourmet kitchen, beautifully appointed with quality appliances, extensive bench space and excellent storage. A generous separate scullery adds further practicality and convenience.\r\n\r\nThree distinct living areas provide exceptional flexibility for both formal and informal occasions, with two opening seamlessly onto north-facing covered timber decks. Complete with outdoor heaters and a gas fire, these inviting spaces have been cleverly designed to deliver outstanding indoor-outdoor living and year-round entertaining.\r\n\r\nAccommodation is equally impressive, comprising four well-proportioned bedrooms, two of which are fitted with thoughtfully designed wardrobe systems. \r\n\r\nTwo luxurious bathrooms and a separate powder room.\r\nFurther features include a separate laundry, extensive storage, excellent work-from-home options, ample off-street parking and electric gates, providing an added sense of security, peace and privacy.\r\n\r\nBeautifully curated interiors, superb craftsmanship and quality finishes throughout reflect the care and attention invested in this remarkable transformation.\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Kohimarama's most desirable locations, you are just a leisurely stroll from Madills Farm, local parks, Kohimarama Beach, cafes and everyday amenities.\r\n\r\nAUCTION\r\n\r\n5:00pm - 24th November 2026\r\nOn Site\r\n(Unless Sold Prior)",
